🧩 Step 10: Full OSPF Flow (Putting Everything Together 🔥)

Now let’s connect all concepts into one clear flow

🧠 What actually happens in OSPF?
Step-by-step (real flow):
1️⃣ Neighbor Discovery
Routers send Hello packets
Become neighbors (2-Way → Full)
2️⃣ DR/BDR Election (if needed)
In broadcast networks
One becomes DR, one BDR
3️⃣ LSA Exchange
Routers share LSAs (topology info)
Build full network map (database)
4️⃣ SPF Calculation
Run shortest path algorithm
Use cost
5️⃣ Routing Table Created
Best paths selected
Traffic starts flowing 🚀

